| File | Content |
|---|---|
| `resilience_report.json` | Findings with stable IDs `RES-<12 hex>` (hash of domain, rule, path, normalised evidence and subject), each with impact, severity band and organisation label, confidence, status (`confirmed`, `accepted`, `manual`, `unverified_external`), evidence snippet, failure scenario and remediation. Also the full instance registry with coverage, alert rules, throttle paths, dependency matrix, signal-chain KPIs, pillar scores, resolved auto findings and limitations. |
