| `resilience_report.md` | Executive summary with signal-chain KPIs (breakers logging transitions, breakers alerting when OPEN, limiters alerting on rejection, throttle paths logging / sending Retry-After, adequate dependencies), pillar scores, inventory and signal-chain table, throttling paths, alert rules, dependency matrix, findings by severity, 15-row domain coverage table, limitations. |

Store these by `component_id` and `run_id` (for example in MongoDB). The catalog hash identifies exactly which rules produced them.

