| R04 | Inbound throttling and rate limiting | protection | HTTP endpoints or limiters exist |
| R05 | Outbound throttling, bulkheads and concurrency | protection | outbound calls or bulkheads exist |
| R06 | Timeouts, retries and backoff composition | protection | outbound calls or retries exist |
| R07 | Circuit breaker event logging | logging | breakers exist |
| R08 | Throttling event logging and the 429/503 contract | logging | limiters, endpoints or bulkheads exist |
| R09 | Metrics instrumentation and exposure | metrics | any resilience instance exists |
| R10 | Alerting — circuit breakers | alerting | breakers exist |
| R11 | Alerting — throttling, bulkheads and retries | alerting | limiters, bulkheads, retries or endpoints exist |
